ind":"announcement","title":"New Cafe View, macOS Support & QoL Improvements","summary":"Hey everyone! A fresh update just landed for Internet Cafe 98. Here's what's new: New Cafe View The cafe has a brand-new look. The room got a visual refresh, so watching your cafe grow from a few beige boxes into a packed LAN den feels better than ever. macOS Support Internet Cafe 98 now runs on macOS! Mac players can download and play it straight from Steam, just like on Windows. Quality of Life Various quality-of-life improvements to make managing your cafe smoother Small fixes and general pol","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:57:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4224490-1839041357037073","game_id":"steam-4224490","kind":"announcement","title":"Faster Expansion, Clearer Research","summary":"We’ve released another update based on your feedback.Earlier ExpansionInternet capacity upgrades now appear earlier and more frequently. You can unlock additional PC slots sooner, with more opportunities to improve your connection throughout the demo.Improved BalanceEarly-game progression has been rebalanced to reduce unnecessary waiting and help you reach the main cafe systems faster.Clearer ResearchResearch descriptions have been rewritten to make each upgrade and its effects easier to underst","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T01:09:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357037073","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:20:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4224490-1839041357033173","game_id":"steam-4224490","kind":"announcement","title":"A Smoother Start, Thanks to Your Feedback"